Sir Cliff Vandertrip of the Order of the Everchain is a human over ten feet tall, in black power armor trimmed in gold and stamped with the Scale's insignia, a great axe at his side and old scars across his face. He was made to be the [[Judge of Ages|Judge]]'s warrior, and thinks of little besides the work.

He carries an Everlight crystal that lights the ground around him and lends a holy edge to the weapons of those who fight beside him. He calls his companions brother.

Cliff is a high-ranking delving specialist of [[Org/The Scale/index|The Scale]], sent with three others to a Joker World at [[Geography/Star 221,325|Star 221,325]].

He tends his companions' injuries after a fight and keeps a written record of their delve in a notebook, so that the work is known if they do not come back.
